210
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:12,000
Have the real Hashira train you.

211
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:14,060
It's for the best, really.

212
00:14:15,340 --> 00:14:17,180
I'll never manifest a mark.

213
00:14:18,180 --> 00:14:21,080
As for Sabito, there's no doubt he would have.

214
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,440
Just forget about me.

215
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:26,500
You're wasting your time.

216
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:32,600
