220
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:44,100
When someone you value more than your own life

221
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:47,360
ends up dying before you instead.

222
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,040
And worse,

223
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:51,700
dies because they were protecting you.

224
00:14:52,580 --> 00:14:54,360
It's an unending pain.

225
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,320
Sabito.

226
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,560
The boy who trained me back on Mount Sigiri.

227
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:04,500
What a strange experience.

228
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,540
Even though they were both already long dead,

229
00:15:08,180 --> 00:15:10,080
