233
00:15:21,700 --> 00:15:22,460
Amazing.

234
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:23,840
Amazing.

235
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:27,220
He saved everyone during the selection.

236
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:30,100
Something I couldn't do.

237
00:15:30,740 --> 00:15:32,800
I was barely able to protect myself.

238
00:15:33,780 --> 00:15:35,380
If Sabito were still here,

239
00:15:35,540 --> 00:15:37,700
I'm sure that he'd be an incredible swordsman.

240
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:41,820
That must be part of the reason

241
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:45,620
