243
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:49,820
I had that same thought myself.

244
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:52,400
Mr. Rengoku.

245
00:15:53,040 --> 00:15:55,880
He sacrificed his own life to protect us.

246
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:57,740
He was incredible.

247
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:00,600
His kindness rivaled his strength.

248
00:16:01,660 --> 00:16:03,200
And he never faltered.

249
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,800
