250
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:11,760
I wished with all my heart

251
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:12,920
that I'd been the one to die

252
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:14,900
instead of Mr. Rengoku that day.

253
00:16:15,660 --> 00:16:17,080
I thought that one day

254
